    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "View Alert Detail",
      "id": "alert-detail",
      "intro": "Detail alert menyediakan informasi lengkap tentang alert termasuk transaksi, rule yang triggered, discussion, dan transaction history customer.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka Alert Detail",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik baris alert pada tabel untuk membuka detail\n• Detail dialog akan muncul dengan 5 tab informasi\n• Gunakan tombol **Close** untuk menutup\n• Bisa juga double-click pada baris alert",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #eff6ff;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eff6ff,#fff);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Alert Detail</span></div><span style=\"padding:4px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;text-transform:uppercase;\">POSITIVE</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;font-size:10px;color:#64748b;text-align:center;\">Klik alert row untuk membuka dialog detail dengan informasi lengkap.</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Tab Alert Detail",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Alert ID** — ID unik alert\n• **UTRNNO** — Universal Transaction Number\n• **Classification** — NEGATIVE / SUSPICIOUS / POSITIVE\n• **Risk Score** — Skor risiko fraud (0-100)\n• **Created Date** — Waktu alert dibuat\n• **Status** — Open / In Progress / Resolved\n• **Assigned To** — User yang handle alert",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fffbeb;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Alert Information</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Alert ID</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">ALT-2024-001234</div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Classification</div><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;display:inline-block;\">POSITIVE</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Risk Score</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">85</div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Status</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Open</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Tab Transaction",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Detail transaksi yang memicu alert\n• **Transaction Details**: Amount, currency, date/time\n• **Customer Info**: Name, card number, customer ID\n• **Merchant Info**: Name, MID, category, location\n• **Additional Data**: Device info, IP address, geo location\n• Data dikelompokkan dalam sections yang rapi",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Transaction Details</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:6px;\">Amount</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Rp 15,000,000</div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Customer</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">John Doe</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Merchant</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">ABC Store</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Tab Triggered Rule",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Menampilkan scenario rule yang memicu alert\n• **Rule Name** — Nama scenario yang triggered\n• **Rule Type** — GENERAL atau CONDITION\n• **Conditions Met** — Kondisi yang terpenuhi\n• **Risk Score** — Skor dari rule\n• Bisa ada multiple rules yang triggered sekaligus",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f3ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#7c3aed);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Triggered Rules</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#fff);border:1px solid #ddd6fe;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Deteksi Transfer Besar</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">GENERAL</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Amount > 10,000,000 AND Frequency > 3</div></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center;\">1 rule triggered</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Tab Discussion & History",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Discussion** — Kolaborasi tim via comments\n  - Add comment / notes\n  - Tag team members\n  - Attach files (optional)\n• **Transaction History** — Riwayat transaksi customer\n  - Last 30 days transaction\n  - Pattern analysis\n  - Comparison dengan transaksi normal",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdfa;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdfa;border:1px solid #5eead4;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#14b8a6;\">Discussion</span><span style=\"padding:4px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">History</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f0fdfa;border:1px solid #99f6e4;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#14b8a6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">JD</span></div><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">John Analyst</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">2 mins ago</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;\">Suspicious pattern detected, escalating to supervisor.</div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center;\">+ Add Comment</div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
